    "updated_at": "2016-01-20T19:32:01Z",
    "body": "Can you cite one actual issue? Typos in markup is handled already by the validator. As for form input, you need to validate what is submitted anyway, and it's simple to choose your own upper limit with the max attribute.\n\nAny change to the spec should have a clear description of what problem it fixes.\n",
