    "created_at": "2016-01-28T08:54:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-28T08:54:24Z",
    "body": "@domenic, we agree that allowing non 4-digit year adds possible UX problems and typo issues.\n\nWhat about this spec proposal:\nminimum allowed date [00:00:00 on UTC 1 January 1970 (Unix time)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unix_time) and maximum [03:14:07 UTC on 19 January 2038 (year 2038 problem)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Year_2038_problem) until specified else with `min` and `max` attribute even if `min=\"-1234567890\" max=\"1234567890\"` (allows also before year 0).\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
