    "created_at": "2016-01-28T09:02:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-28T09:02:04Z",
    "body": "That doesn't allow many birthdates still in use today. It also seems like a bad idea to explicitly add the year 2038 problem to the spec. Also negative years have been discussed before and it's not without problems to allow them. Also you need to consider the `time` element here...\n",
